FS Platform Model 交接总览（V1.0 -> V1.0.1 -> V1.0.2 -> V1.0.3）\par
\par
\b 文档说明\b0\par
本 RTF 为摘要版，完整内容请优先阅读同目录 Markdown：\par
FS_Platform_Model_Handover_V1.0_to_V1.0.3.md\par
\par
\b V1.0.3 核心升级\b0\par
1) 新增 tire.mode: off / fixed / range\par
2) 位移语义拆分：deltaGround / deltaSuspWheel / deltaTire / shockStroke\par
3) 新增 rules 判据层与 targets 判据层\par
4) 分层判定：converged / rulePass / designPass / feasible\par
5) 气动插值显式输出 clamp/fallback 标记\par
6) run_batch summary 扩展为可直接筛选方案\par
\par
\b 主接口保持不变\b0\par
- run_case(caseDef, options)\par
- run_batch(caseArray, options)\par
\par
\b 新增输入层\b0\par
- caseDef.tire\par
- caseDef.rules\par
- caseDef.targets\par
\par
\b 新增输出层\b0\par
- results.tire\par
- results.rules\par
- results.targets\par
- results.range.low / nominal / high（range 模式）\par
\par
\b 气动标记\b0\par
- mapClampedAny\par
- hfClamped / hrClamped / phiClamped / betaClamped\par
- interpFallbackUsed\par
